### Deployment (Cloudflare Workers + Git)

Production for **dsapatterns.io** is driven from this repo via **Cloudflare** (Workers static assets), not only Vercel.

- **Git integration:** Cloudflare dashboard links the Worker to **GitHub**; pushes to **`main`** trigger build when configured. Treat **`main`** as source of truth; **FF-sync `master`** after every `main` push when both exist (`git merge --ff-only` — never force over remote tips).
- **Build + deploy:** `npm run build` then `npx wrangler versions upload` when Git auto-deploy is missing or stuck. **Do not assume `git push` alone updates live Workers.** [`wrangler.jsonc`](wrangler.jsonc): `assets.directory` = `./dist`, `not_found_handling` = `single-page-application`. **Do not** upload without successful Vite build — `dist/` must include `public/` (e.g. `public/games/**`).
- **Worker name:** `"name"` in `wrangler.jsonc` must match Cloudflare Worker name.
- **Stale live site:** Hashed `/assets/*` cache-bust each build; **`index.html`** may lag. After successful deploy: purge CDN (`/` and `/assets/*`, or purge all), hard-refresh/incognito; confirm deploy logs succeeded.
- **Vercel-only config:** [`vercel.json`](vercel.json) rewrites apply on **Vercel**, not Cloudflare Worker. Nested game SPAs (`/games/<slug>/*`) may need extra routing on Cloudflare — `create-web-game.mdc` §12 *Cloudflare vs Vercel*.
- **Sanity check:** `npm run build && npx wrangler versions upload --dry-run`.

