```bash
node --test tests/games/registry-contracts.test.mjs tests/contracts/portfolio.test.mjs
node scripts/games/build-all-embeds.mjs                         # EMBED_GAMES dists + vendor (or SKIP_VENDOR=1)
npx playwright test -c playwright.games.config.mjs e2e/games/campaign-5.spec.mjs
npx playwright test -c playwright.games.config.mjs e2e/games/no-auto-win.spec.mjs
```

E2E `beforeEach`: clear `<slug>.progress` / `_epoch` keys in `localStorage`. Do **not** commit scratch scripts (`check_*.mjs`, `staged_diff.txt`) or `games/*/music/` source folders.

