WebView/Capacitor packaging, Play Store graphics, five-theme checklist, Gradle sync, signing, and common WebView errors → **`convert-web-to-mobile.mdc`** (moved here from this file — single source of truth).

**Bharat Brawlers:** one-command pipeline at `scripts/games/android/run.mjs` over `scripts/games/android/registry.mjs` (**catalog embeds only** — no archived Lumen/Orbit/Ghost SKUs). Theme/audio parity via `audit-parity.mjs` + `music-asset-manifest.json`; only claim “5 themes” in Play copy when `ThemeSwitcher` is visible within 120s (§13). Prefer releasing **flagships that include modes** (TimeTwin, Circuit Flow, GRID) over resurrecting deleted standalones.

**Phase 8 — native shell & Play Vitals hardening** (when shipping WebView APKs): predictive back via `OnBackPressedDispatcher`, non-blocking `onCreate`, `IntentSanitizer` before external `startActivity`, `windowSoftInputMode="adjustResize"`, 16 KB NDK alignment if native libs are added, and `preBuild` Gradle asset sync for AGP 9. Enforced by `apply-native-hardening.mjs` / `audit-native-hardening.mjs` — see conversion rule §14 Phase 8 and skill `webapp-to-android` §5b–§7.
